OL,4,CUS announces new tariff proposals on   
OL,5,CEU, China, and other trade partners -  
OL,6,FDifferent tariffs will apply to        
OL,7,Fdifferent countries and products.      
OL,8,FChina is facing the highest rate of    
OL,9,F"up to 40%" - although the effective   
OL,10,Frate could be lower.          GSee P104
