OL,4,CUS Army to carry out controlled blast  
OL,5,Cof degraded explosives in Iowa -FAn    
OL,6,Fappeals court overturned a decision to 
OL,7,Fstop 68 barrels of lead azide being    
OL,8,Fdetonated; the Army said it was        
OL,9,Fnecessary to protect against an        
OL,10,Funplanned explosion.          GSee P106
OL,12,CEnergy bills to rise by 26% from       
OL,13,CJanuary after gas prices surge -FA     
OL,14,Fhousehold using a typical amount of    
OL,15,Fenergy would see its annual bill rise  
OL,16,Ffrom #1,723 to #2,166 if this level    
OL,17,Fwas sustained for a year.     GSee P107
